/// Heritage notes for the craft techniques in the catalogue.
///
/// Shown to a buyer as the reason a piece costs what it costs, which is the
/// half of "dynamic pricing" a number cannot carry on its own.
///
/// The text is generated and checked for shape rather than fact-checked line by
/// line, so treat it the way you would any unreviewed copy: good enough to
/// demonstrate, not yet good enough to print. The prompt that produced it was
/// explicit about refusing to invent dates, dynasties, GI tags or community
/// names, because a confident paragraph of wrong history on a government
/// project is worse than a plain one.
library;

